flowchart TD
    START[Load user config, dotenv settings and logging] --> CONNECT[Connect to ZEN and create selector UI]
    CONNECT --> MODE{Select stream mode}
    MODE -->|Display: watch ZEN experiment| WATCH[Wait for ZEN-started frames; unknown frame count]
    MODE -->|Display: start selected experiment| PREPARE[Reload XML metadata and prepare selected experiment]
    PREPARE --> ARM[Arm experiment ID filter before starting acquisition]
    ARM --> TRIGGER[Start loaded experiment and monitor status]
    WATCH --> DISPLAY
    TRIGGER --> DISPLAY

    subgraph DISPLAY_PATH[Display pipeline]
        DISPLAY[Receive global frames; reject nonmatching armed IDs] --> FIRST{First frame of acquisition?}
        FIRST -->|Yes| RESET[Clear only plugin-owned layers and reset frame storage]
        FIRST -->|No| STORE
        RESET --> STORE[Store sparse frame key S,T,M,Z,C]
        STORE --> PREVIEW[Default: latest 2D YX preview; optional 7D history]
        PREVIEW --> COMPLETION{Completion trigger?}
        COMPLETION -->|Not yet| DISPLAY
        COMPLETION -->|ZEN status finished| DRAIN[Retain ID filter; wait for expected unique frames or inactivity]
        COMPLETION -->|Watch inactivity or Stop| RESTRUCTURE
        DRAIN --> RESTRUCTURE[Remove preview; merge M tiles into one STZYX mosaic per channel]
        RESTRUCTURE --> RELEASE[Clear experiment ID filter after final restructure]
    end

    CHANNELS[Display channel labels: All or 1-16 for watch; setup channels for selected start] --> RESTART[Convert to zero-based index and restart pipeline reader]
    RESTART -.-> DISPLAY

    MODE -->|OME-ZARR only| CONFIG[Build config from UI; reload XML dimensions and wells]
    subgraph WRITER_PATH[Configured writer shared by plugin and CLI]
        CONFIG --> SUSPEND[Suspend display reader before opening dedicated writer channel]
        SUSPEND --> STREAMS[Open one pixel stream per selected source channel]
        STREAMS --> AUTO{Auto-trigger enabled?}
        AUTO -->|Yes| API_START[Prepare and start experiment; retain returned ID]
        AUTO -->|No| MANUAL[Arm writer; pin to first received experiment ID]
        API_START --> INITIALIZE
        MANUAL --> INITIALIZE[First matching frame: validate GRAY8 or GRAY16 payload and live dimensions]
        INITIALIZE --> EXPECTED[Use positive live counts with XML fallback; build expected T,S,M,C,Z map]
        EXPECTED --> READ[Read frame; reject missing or unrelated experiment IDs before decoding]
        READ --> VALID{New expected coordinate?}
        VALID -->|No: duplicate or unexpected| READ
        VALID -->|Yes| APPEND[Buffer bounded out-of-order frames; append raw slots or merged HCS scene planes]
        APPEND --> ALL{All expected coordinates received?}
        ALL -->|No| IDLE{Inactivity timeout?}
        IDLE -->|No| READ
        ALL -->|Yes| FINALIZE
        IDLE -->|Yes| FINALIZE[Drain pending frames; skip missing slots and close writer]
        FINALIZE --> LAYOUT[Finalize HCS rows or assemble generic TCZYX scene mosaics; higher M wins overlaps]
        LAYOUT --> REPORT[Write acquisition_status.json with received counts and missing coordinates]
        REPORT --> COMPLETE{Acquisition complete?}
        COMPLETE -->|Yes| SUCCESS[Generate requested pyramids; return path and open output]
        COMPLETE -->|No| PARTIAL[Retain partial store; raise IncompleteAcquisitionError; no pyramid or auto-open]
        PARTIAL --> WARNING[Plugin warning or CLI nonzero exit]
        SUCCESS --> RESUME[Plugin: resume display reader in finally]
        WARNING --> RESUME
    end

    RELEASE --> READY[Restore idle controls; ready for next acquisition]
    RESUME --> READY
    READY --> MODE

    classDef display fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#36718c
    classDef writer fill:#e7f2e7,stroke:#39713f
    classDef warning fill:#fff0d6,stroke:#9b6a14
    class DISPLAY,STORE,PREVIEW,DRAIN,RESTRUCTURE display
    class CONFIG,STREAMS,READ,APPEND,FINALIZE,LAYOUT,SUCCESS writer
    class PARTIAL,WARNING warning